      "properties": {
        "snippet": "The OHWL setback and SIZ applicable to each river and district are:\n\nMississippi River:\n   - CA-ROS: 200 foot setback, 100 foot SIZ\n   - CA-RN: 100 foot setback, 50 foot SIZ\n   - CA-RTC: 75 foot setback, 37.5 foot SIZ\n   - CA-UM: 50 foot setback, 25 foot SIZ\n\n\nVermillion River:\n   - CA-ROS: 150 foot setback, 75 foot SIZ\n   - CA-RN: 75 foot setback, 37.5 foot SIZ\n   - CA-SR: 75 foot setback, 37.5 foot SIZ\n\nMinnesota River:\n   - CA-ROS: 150 foot setback, 75 foot SIZ\n\nRum River:\n   - CA:RN: 75 foot setback, 37.5 foot SIZ\n   - CA-RTC: 75 foot setback, 37.5 foot SIZ\n\nCrow River:\n   - CA-RTC: 75 foot setback, 37.5 foot SIZ\n\nThis shapefile is intended to be a generalized depiction of the SIZ.  Delineation of the SIZ on any parcel for development purposes must be undertaken by surveying from the OHWL.\n",
